  <DsSection id="disclosure" title="Disclosures & groups">
    <p>Progressive disclosure is native <code>details/summary</code>, one chevron per level (›, rotating 90° on <code>[open]</code>). The expand-tree — Office → Branch → Invoice → Line — is the preferred drill-down and is mostly no-JS.</p>
    <DsSpec label="Board group with head" code=".cfx-group > .cfx-group-head (gold left rule) — one chevron per level" layout="block">
      <div class="cfx" style="margin:0;padding:12px;min-height:0;border-radius:8px;display:grid;gap:8px">
        <details class="cfx-group" open><summary class="cfx-group-head" style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none"><span class="cfx-group-name">▾ Denver</span><span class="cfx-group-count">63 jobs</span><span class="cfx-group-money">$113,250.00</span></summary><div style="padding:10px 14px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)">10 rows shown · Show all 63 jobs ▾ (53 more)</div></details>
        <details class="cfx-group"><summary class="cfx-group-head" style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none"><span class="cfx-group-name">▸ Fort Collins</span><span class="cfx-group-count">21 jobs</span><span class="cfx-group-money">$54,900.00</span></summary></details>
        <details class="cfx-group"><summary class="cfx-group-head" style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;border-left-color:var(--muted)"><span class="cfx-group-name">▸ Uncategorized</span><span class="cfx-group-count">4 lines</span><span class="cfx-group-money">$1,210.00</span></summary></details>
      </div>
    </DsSpec>
    <DsSpec label="Rail department accordion" code=".dept > .dept-summary + .dept-items > .dept-link (one open at a time)" surface="navy" layout="block">
      <div style="display:grid;gap:8px;max-width:260px">
        <details class="dept" open><summary class="dept-summary"><span class="dept-label">Accounting</span><span class="dept-chevron" aria-hidden="true">›</span></summary><ul class="dept-items"><li><a class="dept-link is-active" href="#disclosure">Invoice Audit</a></li><li><a class="dept-link" href="#disclosure">Friday WIP/AR</a></li><li><span class="dept-link is-soon" aria-disabled="true">Fleet Audit<small class="soon-badge">soon</small></span></li></ul></details>
        <details class="dept"><summary class="dept-summary"><span class="dept-label">Operations</span><span class="dept-chevron" aria-hidden="true">›</span></summary></details>
      </div>
    </DsSpec>
    <ul>
      <li>Summary rows show headline columns as pills; the full column set lives in a labelled detail grid inside the body.</li>
      <li>Auto-open when there are ≤ 2 top-level nodes; filtering auto-opens branches holding hits.</li>
      <li>Category sections default-collapsed, ordered by <code>sort_order</code>; in to-audit-only mode fully-audited sections hide; <strong>Uncategorized is visible, never hidden.</strong></li>
      <li>Re-rendering a body preserves which sections are open (a 6-line review must not cost 12 clicks).</li>
      <li>A progress bar renders at every nesting level, rolled up from the deepest line (<a href="#meters">Meters</a>).</li>
      <li>Two deferred site-wide bugs are recorded: closing a nest while a line is selected must deselect; marking one line passed must not collapse the nest (docs/59).</li>
    </ul>
  </DsSection>

  <DsSection id="show-more" title="Show-more pane">
    <p>The long-list disclosure rule made concrete. The pane is exactly ten rows tall collapsed and expanded; the control states the cost; height is measured in two passes; state persists. Full contract in <code>standards/design/v1.md</code>.</p>
    <div class="ds-pre"><code>const PAGE_SIZE = 10;
const sizePane = (wrap) =&gt; &#123;
  const rowH  = wrap.querySelector("tbody tr[data-job]").getBoundingClientRect().height || 29;
  const headH = wrap.querySelector("thead").getBoundingClientRect().height;
  const base  = Math.ceil(headH + rowH * PAGE_SIZE + 2);
  wrap.style.maxHeight = `$&#123;base&#125;px`;
  const gutter = wrap.offsetHeight - wrap.clientHeight;   // a horizontal scrollbar steals ~15px
  if (gutter &gt; 0) wrap.style.maxHeight = `$&#123;base + gutter&#125;px`;
&#125;;
more.textContent = showAll
  ? `Show first $&#123;PAGE_SIZE&#125; only  ▴`
  : `Show all $&#123;rows.length&#125; jobs  ▾  ($&#123;hidden&#125; more)`;</code></div>
    <DsSpec label="The control" code=".cfx-showmore / .fw-showmore — full width, border-top, left-aligned, 12px" layout="block">
      <div class="cfx" style="margin:0;padding:0;min-height:0;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)"><button class="cfx-showmore" type="button">Show all 63 jobs  ▾  (53 more)</button><button class="cfx-showmore" type="button">Show first 10 only  ▴</button></div>
    </DsSpec>
    <p>Applied: Friday WIP/AR, cash family, runtime board. Outstanding: Invoice Audit, Price List Review, Categorize Price Lines, Credit Memos, Agreement Builder.</p>
  </DsSection>

